cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the run records, please cite the article below."
title: "Deploying AI pathology models at new hospitals: code and run records"
abstract: >-
  Leave-one-site-out evaluation of up to 21 methods on four public pathology cohorts
  (Camelyon17-WILDS, multi-scanner canine cSCC, MIDOG 2021, MIDOG++) at two model scales,
  with the records of all 4,778 training runs, the test predictions of every final run,
  the site acceptance test, and the scripts that regenerate every table and figure of the article.
